<title>USA: Birmingham Steel files for share offer.</title>
<headline>Birmingham Steel files for share offer.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Birmingham Steel Corp said Wednesday it filed a registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for a proposed offering of one million shares of its common stock.</p>
</text>
